# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:
- Added Sniffer Chicken variant (Spawns in the same biomes as the Sniffer Cow variant. Drops Torchflower/Pitcher Plant when killed)
- Added Blue Mooshroom Cow variant (Spawns in the same biomes as the other Moobloom Cow variants. Drops Blue Orchid when killed)
- Added Diamond Chicken Variant from Java Edition 2.0 (Can spawn in Villager Outpost Cages. Instead of Eggs it lays Lapis Lazuli and very rarely Diamonds.)

## Fixes: